      description: 'Hazrat Nuh (A.S.) — episode 2 of 6.',
      captions: [
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 701),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 3681),
          text: 'Episode 2: Try Again, Differently',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 3681),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 15149),
          text:
              'The next afternoon, the four children returned to the park carrying rubbish bags again, but this time Akhlaq was carrying something else: a clipboard.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 15799),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 20029),
          text: 'Mohsin looked at it suspiciously and asked what it was.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 20715),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 24149),
          text: 'Akhlaq proudly called it a management tool.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 25258),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 35117),
          text:
              'Mohsina reminded him that only yesterday he had been promoted from management to cleaning, but Akhlaq announced that management had returned with experience.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 35117),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 48265),
          text:
              'At the top of the page he had written PLAN TO KEEP THE PARK CLEAN, followed by three steps: clean everything, tell everyone not to litter, and hope for the best.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 48665),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 54365),
          text:
              'Imaan stared at the list and asked whether that was really his new strategy.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 54832),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 64445),
          text:
              'Mohsin pointed out that hoping for the best was not exactly a strategy, but Akhlaq insisted that it was emotionally important.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 65053),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 70813),
          text:
              'Mohsina suggested that before doing anything, they should examine what had actually gone wrong.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 71693),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 77693),
          text:
              'The park was not as dirty as it had been before, but the children noticed something interesting.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 78333),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 89141),
          text:
              'Most of the rubbish gathered in the same few places: near the football ground, beside the juice stall, and around a bench where children usually sat after school.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 89646),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 94021),
          text:
              'Mohsin pointed out that the rubbish was not evenly spread everywhere.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 94323),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 99541),
          text:
              'Imaan walked towards the nearest dustbin and then looked back towards the football area.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 99541),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 104301),
          text:
              'The bin was quite far from the place where most people were eating.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 104428),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 114589),
          text:
              'Mohsin laughed as he realised that the previous day they had put up a sign telling everyone to use the bin when the bin itself was inconveniently placed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 114589),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 118709),
          text:
              'Instead of immediately cleaning everything, they began observing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 118709),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 123589),
          text:
              'A boy finished a packet of biscuits near the football ground and looked around.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 123589),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 127537),
          text: 'The nearest bin was almost at the other end of the park.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 127537),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 132357),
          text:
              'He held the empty packet for a moment, then placed it on the edge of a wall.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 132652),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 140157),
          text:
              'Imaan approached him and politely asked whether having a bin closer would make it easier to dispose of rubbish properly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 140157),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 142517),
          text: 'The boy immediately agreed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 142517),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 147125),
          text:
              'A little later, two younger children threw juice straws beside the swings.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 147838),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 151525),
          text: 'Akhlaq rushed towards them and shouted, “Stop!”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 151525),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 153285),
          text: 'Both children froze.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 153540),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 159965),
          text:
              'Imaan quickly reminded him that he sounded more like a police officer than someone trying to teach them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 160325),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 164885),
          text:
              'Mohsina crouched beside the younger children and asked whether they knew where the rubbish belonged.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 164893),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 170413),
          text:
              'When they pointed towards the large bin near the gate, she invited them to help.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 170413),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 175133),
          text:
              'Both children happily picked up the straws and ran towards the bin.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 175633),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 181133),
          text:
              'Akhlaq watched in surprise and admitted that they had listened to Mohsina immediately.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 181133),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 187389),
          text:
              'She smiled and explained that he had frightened them, while she had invited them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 187972),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 193585),
          text:
              'Akhlaq immediately wrote a new rule on his clipboard: Do not begin with shouting.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 194102),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 198547),
          text:
              'Mohsin remarked that this advice might help him in many areas of life.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 198547),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 204204),
          text:
              'By the end of the hour, the children had learned more than they had cleaned.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 204204),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 216709),
          text:
              'Some people littered simply because they were careless, some because the bins were inconvenient, some younger children had never really thought about it, and some people genuinely did not care.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 217068),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 226677),
          text:
              'Imaan looked again at their original sign, KEEP OUR PARK CLEAN, and realised that it told people what to do but not why.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 226677),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 229837),
          text: 'They decided to create smaller messages.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 230508),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 234197),
          text: 'Mohsina suggested, THIS PARK BELONGS TO ALL OF US.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 234660),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 238717),
          text: 'Imaan added, A CLEAN PLACE BEGINS WITH ONE PERSON.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 239097),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 245765),
          text:
              'Mohsin suggested placing another message near the football ground: YOUR WRAPPER CAN WALK TEN STEPS WITH YOU.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 246418),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 248845),
          text: 'Akhlaq immediately approved that one.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 248845),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 260605),
          text:
              'The children decided to speak to the park caretaker about moving a dustbin closer to the football area and to ask the juice seller whether a small waste basket could be kept beside his stall.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 261112),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 270733),
          text:
              'Akhlaq looked at his clipboard and realised that they were now doing much more than the previous day, yet somehow less of their work involved simply picking up rubbish.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 270733),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 273933),
          text: 'A familiar voice came from behind them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 274293),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 281133),
          text:
              'Zameer observed that perhaps today they were trying to solve the problem instead of merely reacting to it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 281459),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 286701),
          text:
              'Akhlaq immediately told him that they were ready to hear what Nuh (A.S.) had done differently.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 287256),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 293701),
          text:
              'Sitting beneath the tree, Zameer explained that in Surah Nuh, Nuh (A.S.) describes his own effort to Allah.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 293701),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 300701),
          text:
              'He had already told them that Nuh called his people night and day, but the account continued.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 301624),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 308749),
          text:
              'Nuh (A.S.) also called them openly, and he spoke to them both publicly and privately.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 309309),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 315789),
          text:
              'Mohsina immediately recognised the lesson: he did not rely on only one method.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 316267),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 319229),
          text: 'Zameer explained that people are different.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 319229),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 324637),
          text:
              'One person may listen in a group, while another may feel embarrassed in front of others.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 324637),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 331637),
          text:
              'One may need a public reminder, while another may respond better to a private conversation.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 331637),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 337637),
          text:
              'The message of Nuh (A.S.) remained the same, but the way he delivered it varied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 338034),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 347725),
          text:
              'Imaan understood that the principle was similar to their cleaning project: the goal remained the same, but the method could improve.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 348128),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 356485),
          text:
              'Zameer told them that when one good method failed, they should not immediately assume that the good goal itself had failed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 356892),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 362845),
          text:
              'Mohsin admitted that perhaps their goal had been right from the beginning, but their method had been weak.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 363299),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 369573),
          text:
              'Mohsina realised that persistence did not mean repeating exactly the same action forever.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 370780),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 380573),
          text:
              'Zameer summarised the lesson by telling them that persistence without thought can become stubbornness, while persistence with wisdom becomes improvement.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 380899),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 384573),
          text: 'Imaan then asked the question everyone was wondering about.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 385047),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 391421),
          text:
              'If Nuh (A.S.) tried so many different approaches, did everyone finally listen?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 392749),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 394543),
          text: 'Zameer quietly answered no.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 394543),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 397076),
          text: 'The children were surprised.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 397815),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 403261),
          text:
              'Akhlaq asked why he continued changing his method if so many people still refused.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 405040),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 411649),
          text:
              'Zameer explained that in ordinary matters, sometimes stopping or changing a goal may be sensible.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 411649),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 416629),
          text: 'But Nuh (A.S.) was a Messenger carrying a command from Allah.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 416629),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 423009),
          text:
              'His mission did not depend on whether people applauded him or whether results came quickly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 423009),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 425606),
          text: 'He continued because he was obeying Allah.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 427412),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 433630),
          text:
              'Imaan realised that sincere effort had several parts: sincerity, wisdom and patience.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 434128),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 441575),
          text:
              'Akhlaq added that it also needed a proper management plan and raised his clipboard proudly, making everyone laugh.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 441575),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 446157),
          text:
              'The following morning, the four children tested their new ideas.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 446698),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 455177),
          text:
              'Mohsin and Imaan spoke respectfully to the park caretaker and explained that most of the rubbish collected near the football area.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 455177),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 458971),
          text: 'The caretaker agreed that moving a bin closer made sense.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 459504),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 468493),
          text:
              'Mohsina asked the juice seller whether a small waste basket could be placed beside his stall, and after some discussion, he agreed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 468982),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 480493),
          text:
              'Akhlaq took responsibility for the younger children and, instead of shouting, turned rubbish disposal into a game by asking them who could find the bin before he counted to ten.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 480493),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 483813),
          text: 'By lunchtime, something had clearly changed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 483813),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 486941),
          text: 'There was still some rubbish, but much less than before.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 487501),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 490541),
          text: 'Akhlaq proudly announced that their plan had worked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 491623),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 494455),
          text: 'Zameer, who had arrived quietly, corrected him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 494455),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 497021),
          text: 'It had worked better, not perfectly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 497989),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 499465),
          text: 'Imaan understood the point.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 499465),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 504141),
          text:
              'They should not expect one new idea to solve everything immediately.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 504349),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 507629),
          text: 'Then something happened that challenged them again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 507629),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 513469),
          text:
              'The same older boy who had mocked them previously sat on a bench eating chips.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 513469),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 522469),
          text:
              'When he finished, he looked towards the new bin, then towards the children, and deliberately dropped the empty packet onto the ground.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 523118),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 528317),
          text:
              'Mohsin became angry, while Akhlaq immediately started walking towards him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 528725),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 535317),
          text:
              'Zameer stopped him gently and told him that before speaking, he should decide how he wanted to speak.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 535968),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 539317),
          text: 'Akhlaq took a breath and approached the boy calmly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 539317),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 544317),
          text:
              'He picked up the packet and told him that they were trying to make the park better.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 544803),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 551629),
          text:
              'The boy did not have to help them, but deliberately making the place worse was not impressive.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 551629),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 554930),
          text: 'For a moment, the older boy had no reply.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 555675),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 559185),
          text: 'Akhlaq placed the packet in the bin and walked away.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 559632),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 564253),
          text:
              'Mohsin was surprised by how calmly Akhlaq had handled the situation.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 564253),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 568253),
          text: 'But the incident raised another question.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 568601),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 578253),
          text:
              'Imaan asked what happens when people do not merely ignore a good effort, but actually laugh at it and try to make the person feel foolish.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 578821),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 581093),
          text: 'Zameer’s expression became serious.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 581093),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 584221),
          text: 'He explained that this had happened to Nuh (A.S.) too.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 584221),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 595210),
          text:
              'There came a time when Allah commanded him to build the Ark, and while he was building it, leaders from among his people passed by and mocked him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 595210),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 598341),
          text: 'The children immediately became quiet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 598341),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 602789),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked towards the older boy across the park.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 604189),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 614429),
          text:
              'Zameer explained that sometimes the hardest test is not when people refuse to help, but when they make a person feel foolish for trying to do what is right.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 615087),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 617389),
          text: 'Mohsina asked what happened next.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 617766),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 623869),
          text:
              'Zameer replied that this was when a person discovered whether his goodness depended upon other people’s respect.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 624157),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 632157),
          text:
              'As Zameer walked away, Akhlaq protested that he always seemed to leave exactly when the story became difficult.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 632649),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 637665),
          text:
              'Zameer simply reminded him that he had wanted to learn patience from Nuh (A.S.).',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 638157),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 640855),
          text: 'The children then looked around the park.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 640855),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 646125),
          text:
              'Their problem had not disappeared, but something had improved.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 646125),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 661125),
          text:
              'The newly placed bin near the football ground already contained several wrappers, the small basket beside the juice stall was half full, and two younger children were reminding each other not to throw rubbish near the swings.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 661125),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 670813),
          text:
              'Their effort was beginning to work, not because they had simply worked harder, but because they had learned to work better.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 670813),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 675813),
          text: 'And that, they realised, was another form of patience.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 675813),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 684061),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day: Try a Better Way',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 684061),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 686381),
          text:
              'Choose one good thing you have been trying to do but which is not working very well.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 686381),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 689621),
          text: 'Instead of giving up, change the method.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 689621),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 694781),
          text:
              'Ask yourself: “Is the goal wrong, or does my method need improvement?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 694781),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 696301),
          text: 'Level-Up',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 696301),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 702261),
          text:
              'Choose one useful message today and communicate it in two different respectful ways.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 702261),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 706469),
          text: 'Keep the principle the same, but improve how you deliver it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 706469),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 709002),
          text: 'Next Episode: When People Laugh',
        ),
      ],
    ),
    Story(
      id: 'nuh_en_03',
      title: 'Ep 3 · When People Laugh',
      narrator: 'Imaan & Akhlaq',
      coverAsset: 'assets/covers/nuh.webp',
      audioAsset: 'assets/audio/en/nuh/03_when_people_laugh.ogg',
      category: StoryCategory.prophets,
      description: 'Hazrat Nuh (A.S.) — episode 3 of 6.',
      captions: [
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 546),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 3466),
          text: 'Episode 3: When People Laugh',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 3466),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 8372),
          text:
              'By the third day, the children’s cleanliness project had become noticeable around the neighbourhood.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 9206),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 23114),
          text:
              'The new dustbin near the football ground was being used regularly, the small waste basket beside the juice stall was filling up instead of the ground around it, and several younger children had begun reminding one another to use the bins.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 23114),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 27714),
          text:
              'The park was not perfectly clean, but it was certainly better than before.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 27986),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 39282),
          text:
              'Imaan was pleased because their effort was beginning to produce visible results, while Mohsina was even happier that some of the younger children were copying their behaviour without being told repeatedly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 40069),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 43442),
          text: 'Akhlaq, however, had developed a new problem.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 43442),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 47162),
          text: 'He had started carrying his clipboard everywhere.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 47521),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 54242),
          text:
              'Mohsin noticed him standing near the football ground, carefully marking something on the page, and asked what he was doing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 55686),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 60650),
          text: 'Akhlaq replied very seriously that he was measuring progress.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 60650),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 70490),
          text:
              'When Mohsin looked at the sheet, he found three headings: Wrappers in the Bin, Wrappers on the Ground, and People Who Need Improvement.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 70881),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 76610),
          text:
              'Mohsin pointed towards the last heading and asked whether Akhlaq was actually keeping a list of people.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 77038),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 82258),
          text:
              'Akhlaq quickly covered the page and said that the information was confidential.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 82569),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 90818),
          text:
              'Imaan overheard them and warned him that the project was supposed to improve the park, not establish a neighbourhood intelligence agency.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 91378),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 95464),
          text:
              'Their laughter stopped when three older boys entered through the gate.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 95464),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 99306),
          text: 'They were the same boys who had teased them previously.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 99306),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 105544),
          text:
              'One of them looked at the new signs, then at the children carrying rubbish bags, and smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 105544),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 108872),
          text: '“The cleaning team is back,” he announced loudly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 108872),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 114866),
          text:
              'His friend laughed and added, “Maybe we should call them whenever our street gets dirty.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 115616),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 119369),
          text: 'Akhlaq immediately looked towards Imaan.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 119994),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 124594),
          text: 'She could tell that he was trying very hard not to answer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 125185),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 129674),
          text: 'Mohsin quietly said that ignoring them might be best.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 129674),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 136802),
          text:
              'The boys continued walking, but one of them deliberately changed direction and passed close to the children.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 136802),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 144802),
          text:
              'He finished a packet of chips, looked directly at Akhlaq and dropped the empty packet onto the ground.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 144802),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 146562),
          text: '“There,” he said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 146562),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 148802),
          text: '“More work for you.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 148802),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 150802),
          text: 'His friends laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 151276),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 153802),
          text: 'Akhlaq’s hand tightened around the clipboard.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 154770),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 156770),
          text: 'He whispered that he had a response.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 157212),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 162770),
          text:
              'Imaan replied that she was certain he did, and that made her even more worried.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 162770),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 166770),
          text: 'The boys walked towards the football ground, still laughing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 167292),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 171770),
          text: 'Akhlaq picked up the packet, but his face was red with anger.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 172162),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 177738),
          text:
              'Mohsin shook his head and said that perhaps they should forget the entire project for the day.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 177738),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 183738),
          text:
              'Cleaning was one thing, he said, but being treated like someone’s servant was another.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 184218),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 191338),
          text:
              'Mohsina agreed that the boys’ behaviour was wrong, but she did not think abandoning the park would teach them anything.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 191910),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 197906),
          text:
              'Akhlaq immediately replied that perhaps the boys did not deserve to be taught anything.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 197906),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 206106),
          text:
              'Yesterday they had ignored them, today they were laughing at them, and tomorrow they would probably bring rubbish from home.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 206643),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 209646),
          text: 'Imaan could understand why he was angry.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 209646),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 214666),
          text:
              'Being ignored had been frustrating, but being laughed at felt different.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 214674),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 216903),
          text: 'It made their effort seem foolish.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 216903),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 226982),
          text:
              'She looked around the park and suddenly became aware of the gloves on her hands, the rubbish bag she was carrying and the sign they had painted themselves.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 226982),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 232635),
          text:
              'For the first time, she wondered how they must look to everyone else.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 232635),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 237887),
          text:
              'Quietly, she said that perhaps they were taking the project too seriously.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 237887),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 245522),
          text:
              'A voice behind them answered, “Then perhaps today is the right day to ask who decides whether goodness is foolish.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 246322),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 250024),
          text: 'They turned and saw Zameer approaching from the path.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 250626),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 257730),
          text:
              'Akhlaq asked him to please say that today’s story involved someone successfully answering people who laughed at him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 258156),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 266010),
          text:
              'Zameer smiled and said that it certainly involved people laughing, but perhaps not in the way Akhlaq was hoping.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 266531),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 271530),
          text:
              'Zameer sat with them beneath the tree and asked what had happened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 271530),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 276578),
          text:
              'They explained the older boys’ mockery and the deliberately dropped packet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 277068),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 285578),
          text:
              'Mohsin said that he could tolerate people refusing to help, but he did not enjoy being humiliated for doing something useful.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 285890),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 291578),
          text:
              'Imaan admitted that the boys had made her wonder whether their whole project looked childish.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 292033),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 293578),
          text: 'Zameer listened carefully.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 294546),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 299846),
          text:
              'Then he asked whether keeping the park clean had been a good thing before the boys laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 300746),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 301646),
          text: 'Mohsina said yes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 301646),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 306726),
          text:
              'He asked whether their laughter made littering good or cleanliness harmful.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 314514),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 315514),
          text: 'The children answered no.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 315514),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 318714),
          text: 'Then he asked what exactly had changed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 318714),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 322775),
          text: 'After a pause, Akhlaq replied, “How we felt about it.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 323259),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 323841),
          text: 'Zameer nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 323841),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 330667),
          text:
              'The action had not suddenly become foolish; their opinion had made the children feel foolish.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 331042),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 335642),
          text:
              'Zameer explained that this was one of the difficult tests of doing good.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 335642),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 343442),
          text:
              'Sometimes people do not merely refuse to join you; they try to make you embarrassed about being different.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 343928),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 348762),
          text:
              'Mohsin asked whether this had happened to Nuh (A.S.), and Zameer said yes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 348762),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 359050),
          text:
              'He reminded them that Nuh (A.S.) had called his people towards Allah for a very long time, using different approaches, yet many continued to reject him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 359050),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 363250),
          text: 'Then Allah commanded Nuh (A.S.) to build the Ark.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 363250),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 370450),
          text:
              'The Qur’an tells us that as he was constructing it, leaders from among his people passed by him and mocked him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 370898),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 378378),
          text:
              'Akhlaq looked towards the boys across the park and asked whether they really laughed while Nuh (A.S.) was obeying Allah.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 379438),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 380978),
          text: 'Zameer answered yes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 380978),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 384698),
          text: 'That seemed to trouble him more than he expected.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 385148),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 394178),
          text:
              'Zameer explained that Surah Hud tells us clearly that whenever leaders of Nuh’s people passed by while he was constructing the Ark, they mocked him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 394386),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 401386),
          text:
              'The Qur’an does not require us to invent all the exact words they used or every detail of what they thought.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 401386),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 415096),
          text:
              'What Allah tells us is enough: Nuh (A.S.) was carrying out Allah’s command, and people who did not understand or believe in his mission treated him as someone worthy of ridicule.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 415467),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 417877),
          text: 'Imaan thought about that for a moment.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 417877),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 423533),
          text:
              'Something could look foolish to people and still be completely right.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 424166),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 429014),
          text:
              'Zameer agreed and said that people’s laughter was not evidence.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 429580),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 431372),
          text: 'Mohsin repeated the sentence.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 431937),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 437748),
          text:
              'Zameer added that popularity was not evidence either, nor was being outnumbered.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 437748),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 444294),
          text:
              'If ten people laughed at something right, their number did not turn wrong into right.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 444862),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 450012),
          text:
              'Mohsina asked whether Nuh (A.S.) became angry when they mocked him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 450492),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 454142),
          text: 'Zameer told them that the Qur’an records his response.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 454142),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 463330),
          text:
              'He told his people that if they mocked him, then a time would come when they would know upon whom a humiliating punishment would fall.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 463330),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 470130),
          text:
              'Nuh (A.S.) did not abandon Allah’s command merely because people ridiculed him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 471409),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 473770),
          text: 'Akhlaq realised that Nuh (A.S.) had answered them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 474671),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 479698),
          text:
              'Zameer explained that patience did not mean a person was never allowed to answer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 479698),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 486098),
          text:
              'It meant mockery did not control their behaviour or make them abandon what Allah had commanded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 487298),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 499826),
          text:
              'Imaan looked at the boys again and asked whether that meant they did not have to pretend that laughter did not bother them, and they also did not have to let people continue behaving badly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 500207),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 506306),
          text:
              'Zameer agreed, but reminded them that they should not become worse than those who mocked them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 506306),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 513626),
          text:
              'He explained that there was a difference between defending what was right and fighting simply because someone had injured your pride.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 514194),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 518354),
          text: 'Sometimes the best response was calm explanation.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 518354),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 522754),
          text: 'Sometimes it was ignoring someone who only wanted attention.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 522754),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 528194),
          text:
              'Sometimes repeated behaviour required involving a responsible adult.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 528194),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 533754),
          text:
              'What mattered was that they did not allow another person’s mockery to decide their values.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 534709),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 544922),
          text:
              'Mohsin thought about the Ark and pointed out that Nuh (A.S.) knew why he was building it because Allah had commanded him, while they were just cleaning a park.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 545384),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 548522),
          text: 'Zameer said that difference was very important.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 548522),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 555970),
          text:
              'They should never compare their small project with the Prophethood of Nuh (A.S.) as though the two were equal.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 555970),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 560450),
          text: 'They were simply taking a lesson from his steadfastness.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 560450),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 568130),
          text:
              'Their responsibility was to make sure their own action was genuinely good, safe and sensible.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 568130),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 573650),
          text:
              'Once they knew that, someone laughing did not automatically make it wrong.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 573650),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 574553),
          text:
              'Akhlaq summed it up: first ask whether the action is right, then whether the method is wise, and after that, laughter is just laughter.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 574553),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 575098),
          text: 'Zameer nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 575098),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 579658),
          text:
              'Just then, a football rolled across the grass and stopped near them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 579658),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 582698),
          text: 'One of the older boys shouted, “Cleaner!',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 582698),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 583818),
          text: 'Send the ball back!”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 594709),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 595718),
          text: 'Akhlaq slowly stood.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 595718),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 601742),
          text:
              'For a moment, he looked as though he might kick the ball in the opposite direction.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 601742),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 604661),
          text: 'Instead, he picked it up and threw it back.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 604661),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 608180),
          text: 'The older boy caught it and laughed, “Good service!”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 608786),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 621034),
          text:
              'Akhlaq took a breath and called back calmly that they could laugh if they wanted, but the children were still going to keep the park clean, and the boys should stop throwing rubbish on purpose.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 621034),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 624434),
          text: 'The boy replied that they would pick it up anyway.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 625015),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 631234),
          text:
              'Akhlaq told him that helping keep the park clean did not mean others should deliberately make it dirty.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 631234),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 634034),
          text: 'The boy shrugged and returned to the game.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 634601),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 638045),
          text: 'Nothing dramatic happened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 638045),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 638944),
          text: 'Nobody apologised.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 640441),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 642688),
          text: 'Nobody applauded Akhlaq.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 643736),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 648624),
          text: 'The boys did not suddenly join the cleaning team.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 648624),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 653527),
          text: 'But Akhlaq walked back feeling strangely satisfied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 654226),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 657883),
          text: 'Mohsin smiled and asked whether there had been no argument.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 658479),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 664969),
          text:
              'Akhlaq replied that he had considered seventeen responses and rejected sixteen immediately.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 664969),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 671732),
          text:
              'When asked about the seventeenth, he pointed at Imaan and said that she had been watching.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 671732),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 676938),
          text:
              'The children continued working, but the mockery did not stop completely.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 676938),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 679938),
          text: 'One boy called them the “park police.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 679938),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 683938),
          text: 'Another asked Mohsin whether he had been hired as a cleaner.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 683938),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 688938),
          text: 'This time, however, the comments affected them differently.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 690342),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 695866),
          text:
              'Mohsina reminded everyone that being useful was nothing to be embarrassed about.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 696226),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 707306),
          text:
              'Imaan added that there was no shame in cleaning anyway; the embarrassing behaviour was deliberately making a shared place dirty and expecting others to deal with it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 707306),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 710546),
          text: 'Later, something unexpected happened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 710546),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 713590),
          text:
              'A younger boy came into the park carrying an ice-cream wrapper.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 713874),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 718874),
          text:
              'He looked towards the older children, then towards Akhlaq and his friends.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 718874),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 721874),
          text: 'Instead of dropping it, he walked to the bin.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 721874),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 725288),
          text: 'One of the older boys called out, “Careful!',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 725288),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 727874),
          text: 'The cleaning team is watching!”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 727874),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 731874),
          text:
              'The little boy turned around and said, “I’m not doing it because of them.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 731874),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 739762),
          text:
              'When asked why, he shrugged and replied, “Because the bin is there,” before running towards the swings.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 739762),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 742802),
          text: 'For a moment, nobody said anything.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 743565),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 744962),
          text: 'Mohsina smiled first.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 745386),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 747842),
          text: 'Imaan whispered that she had heard it too.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 748322),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 753682),
          text:
              'Mohsin said that the boy was not even helping them; he was simply doing the right thing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 754235),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 760610),
          text:
              'Zameer, who had watched from a distance, returned and said that perhaps this was worth remembering.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 760610),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 764130),
          text: 'Goodness did not always spread with an announcement.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 764130),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 767490),
          text: 'Sometimes people simply began copying it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 767490),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 770370),
          text: 'The children sat down for a short break.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 770806),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 774925),
          text:
              'Mohsin admitted that he was still bothered by the older boys’ laughter.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 775403),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 780278),
          text:
              'Zameer told him that courage did not mean never feeling embarrassed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 780278),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 785503),
          text:
              'Sometimes courage meant feeling embarrassed and continuing anyway.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 785859),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 789843),
          text:
              'Imaan asked how Nuh (A.S.) managed to continue when people mocked him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 790218),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 800586),
          text:
              'Zameer answered carefully that the Qur’an does not tell us every private thought or feeling he experienced, so they should not invent them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 800586),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 804586),
          text: 'What it does show is his steadfast action.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 804586),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 808266),
          text: 'He continued with what Allah had commanded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 809359),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 813026),
          text:
              'Mohsina realised that they knew his patience because of what he kept doing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 814114),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 818834),
          text:
              'Zameer agreed that character often became visible through repeated choices.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 820290),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 827294),
          text:
              'Akhlaq looked around the park and said that this was like coming back there even after people littered and laughed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 827844),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 828504),
          text: 'Zameer agreed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 829274),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 834749),
          text:
              'Akhlaq sighed that Nuh (A.S.) was making the project much harder to quit.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 834749),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 843877),
          text:
              'Before leaving, Zameer picked up Akhlaq’s clipboard and wrote at the bottom: DO NOT LET RIDICULE CHOOSE YOUR DIRECTION.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 844419),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 845611),
          text: 'Akhlaq read it twice.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 845611),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 853214),
          text:
              'Then Mohsin asked how many people had actually believed after all those years of calling and mockery.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 854147),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 857250),
          text: 'Zameer became quiet and said, “Not many.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 857817),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 858610),
          text: 'Mohsin frowned.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 859224),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 868810),
          text:
              'Akhlaq looked genuinely shocked that after so long, after different methods and after enduring mockery, only a few believed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 869256),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 872490),
          text: 'Imaan slowly understood the next lesson.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 873618),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 877698),
          text:
              'What if someone did everything they were supposed to do and only a few people joined them?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 878876),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 882082),
          text: 'Zameer said that was exactly tomorrow’s question.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 882723),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 887198),
          text:
              'Mohsina imagined organising a clean-up day and hardly anyone coming.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 887718),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 891618),
          text:
              'Akhlaq immediately told her not to say things like that aloud.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 892848),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 896946),
          text:
              'Zameer smiled and suggested that perhaps they should organise one.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 896946),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 901706),
          text:
              'As the children began packing, Akhlaq looked back at the older boys.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 901706),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 908306),
          text:
              'One of them drank from a bottle and, almost without thinking, began lowering it towards the ground.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 908306),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 913554),
          text:
              'Then he stopped, looked towards the bin, walked over and dropped the bottle inside.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 913554),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 918554),
          text:
              'He did not look towards the children, apologise or thank them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 919131),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 921554),
          text: 'Mohsin had seen it too and smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 922004),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 927554),
          text:
              'Akhlaq whispered that he wanted to mark it on the clipboard, but Imaan told him to just let it happen.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 927554),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 932554),
          text:
              'For once, they allowed a small piece of goodness to remain unnoticed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 933522),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 953522),
          text: 'Perhaps that was part of the lesson too.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 953522),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 953656),
          text:
              'Challenge of the Day: Do Not Let Laughter Change What Is Right',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 953656),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 953869),
          text:
              'Choose one good, sensible action that you sometimes feel embarrassed doing because other people may laugh or tease you.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 953869),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 963290),
          text:
              'It might be keeping a place clean, refusing to cheat, speaking respectfully, helping someone, admitting a mistake, praying when appropriate, or refusing to join something wrong.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 963290),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 971210),
          text:
              'Before stopping because of other people’s reactions, ask yourself: “Would this action still be right if nobody laughed at me?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 971210),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 976638),
          text:
              'If the answer is yes, do not let ridicule alone make the decision for you.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 976638),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 977958),
          text: 'Level-Up',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 977958),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 982318),
          text: 'If someone mocks you today, do not rush to insult them back.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 982318),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 993426),
          text:
              'Give yourself a few seconds and choose between three responses: ignore it, answer calmly, or seek help from a responsible adult if the behaviour becomes repeated or harmful.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 993426),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 996766),
          text: 'Patience does not mean becoming weak.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 996766),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1001526),
          text:
              'It means refusing to let someone else’s bad behaviour control yours.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1001526),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1003611),
          text: 'Next Episode: Only a Few',
        ),
      ],
    ),
    Story(
      id: 'nuh_en_04',
      title: 'Ep 4 · Only a Few',
      narrator: 'Imaan & Akhlaq',
      coverAsset: 'assets/covers/nuh.webp',
      audioAsset: 'assets/audio/en/nuh/04_only_a_few.ogg',
      category: StoryCategory.prophets,
      description: 'Hazrat Nuh (A.S.) — episode 4 of 6.',
      captions: [
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 675),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 2795),
          text: 'Episode 4: Only a Few',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 2795),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 6295),
          text: 'The clean-up day was supposed to be their biggest effort yet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 6295),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 12273),
          text:
              'For three days, Imaan, Akhlaq, Mohsin and Mohsina had been inviting children from the neighbourhood.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 13103),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 18543),
          text:
              'They had spoken to classmates, neighbours, shopkeepers and younger children in the park.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 19066),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 24683),
          text:
              'Mohsina had even made a small poster that read, “Saturday Clean-Up Morning — Everyone Can Help.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 25185),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 33471),
          text:
              'Akhlaq had insisted on adding, “Snacks After Work,” because, according to him, every successful movement required refreshments.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 33471),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 37971),
          text:
              'By Friday evening, Akhlaq was convinced that a crowd would arrive.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 37971),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 45971),
          text:
              'He had counted at least twenty children who had said things like, “Maybe,” “I’ll try,” “Probably,” or “If I wake up.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 45971),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 49731),
          text:
              'In Akhlaq’s mind, these were almost the same as confirmed attendance.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 50268),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 58039),
          text:
              'Mohsin warned him not to count people before they actually came, but Akhlaq had already divided the group into teams.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 58039),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 64799),
          text:
              'One team would clean near the football ground, another would work around the swings, and a third would help make new signs.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 64799),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 68839),
          text: 'He had even written TEAM LEADERS at the top of his clipboard.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 68839),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 70359),
          text: 'Saturday morning arrived.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 70743),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 72567),
          text: 'Imaan reached the park first.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 73143),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 77155),
          text: 'Mohsina came a few minutes later carrying gloves and bags.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 77690),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 81216),
          text: 'Mohsin arrived with a box of chalk for the signs.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 81857),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 86849),
          text:
              'Akhlaq walked in proudly with the clipboard tucked under his arm.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 86849),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 87871),
          text: 'They waited.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 87871),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 89607),
          text: 'Five minutes passed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 89655),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 91175),
          text: 'Then ten.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 91935),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 95615),
          text: 'A younger boy named Bilal arrived with his sister.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 96135),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 99775),
          text: 'Akhlaq smiled and announced that the first team was there.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 99775),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 102055),
          text: 'Another ten minutes passed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 102055),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 104055),
          text: 'Nobody else came.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 104539),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 108655),
          text:
              'Mohsin checked the time and suggested that perhaps people were late.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 109623),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 111623),
          text: 'Akhlaq insisted that they were definitely late.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 111623),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 122623),
          text:
              'After another fifteen minutes, one boy arrived, looked around, asked where the snacks were, and then left when he discovered they would be served after the cleaning.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 123195),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 124623),
          text: 'Mohsina tried not to laugh.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 125052),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 130273),
          text:
              'Akhlaq stared after him and announced that he was removing the boy from the official record.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 130727),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 133454),
          text: 'Imaan looked towards the park gate.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 133454),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 134704),
          text: 'Still nobody.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 135386),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 141698),
          text:
              'Akhlaq had prepared twenty pairs of simple paper badges that said CLEAN PARK TEAM.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 141911),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 143725),
          text: 'Eighteen remained untouched.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 143725),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 146717),
          text: 'His excitement slowly disappeared.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 147284),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 151555),
          text:
              'Mohsin sat down on the bench and said that he thought this was it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 151555),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 158835),
          text:
              'Akhlaq looked at the almost empty park and complained that twenty people had said they were coming.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 159351),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 171693),
          text:
              'Mohsina corrected him that twenty people had said things that sounded slightly like coming.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 171693),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 175426),
          text: 'That did not help.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 175426),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 175427),
          text:
              'Bilal and his sister had already started picking up wrappers near the swings.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 175427),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 177927),
          text: 'Imaan looked at them and then at the unused bags.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 177927),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 180527),
          text: 'She said they could still begin.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 180954),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 186927),
          text:
              'Akhlaq frowned and asked how they could call it a neighbourhood clean-up with only six people.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 187338),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 191634),
          text:
              'Mohsin added that it looked more like a family meeting with rubbish bags.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 192217),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 194356),
          text: 'Mohsina smiled, but Akhlaq did not.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 194356),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 197175),
          text: 'He looked genuinely disappointed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 197895),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 209255),
          text:
              'They had put up posters, invited everyone, changed their method, avoided shouting, made the task easy and even promised snacks, yet almost nobody came.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 210332),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 214503),
          text:
              'Akhlaq dropped onto the bench and concluded that they had failed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 215383),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 219703),
          text:
              'A familiar voice replied from behind them, “How did you decide that?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 220959),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 222875),
          text: 'Zameer was walking towards them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 223423),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 225703),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked up and said, “By counting.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 226903),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 229303),
          text: 'Zameer smiled and asked what he had counted.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 230247),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 232151),
          text: 'Akhlaq answered, “People.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 232679),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 235951),
          text: 'Zameer then asked what number meant success.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 236609),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 239351),
          text: 'Akhlaq opened his mouth, then stopped.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 239351),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 241351),
          text: 'He had no answer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 241777),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 247311),
          text:
              'Zameer sat beside them and looked towards Bilal and his sister, who were still working.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 247311),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 257279),
          text:
              'He asked whether they had invited people, whether some had come, whether those who came were helping, and whether the park was becoming cleaner.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 257279),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 260919),
          text: 'The answer to every question was yes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 260919),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 265479),
          text:
              'So why, he asked, had they already called the effort a failure?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 265992),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 270024),
          text:
              'Akhlaq pointed towards the unused badges and said that nobody had come.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 270682),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 274437),
          text: 'Mohsina laughed and reminded him that somebody had come.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 274907),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 281995),
          text:
              'Zameer explained that what Akhlaq really meant was that not enough people had come to match the picture in his mind.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 281995),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 285223),
          text: 'Sometimes numbers told useful things.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 285223),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 291595),
          text:
              'If someone organised an event and almost nobody came, it was sensible to ask why.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 291595),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 296995),
          text:
              'Perhaps the timing was wrong, the invitation unclear or people were busy.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 296995),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 299315),
          text: 'They should learn from results.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 299315),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 305475),
          text:
              'But numbers did not always tell them whether something was right, sincere or valuable.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 305914),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 308876),
          text: 'Imaan asked whether this was about Nuh (A.S.).',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 309860),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 311641),
          text: 'Zameer smiled and said yes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 311641),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 319504),
          text:
              'He reminded them that Nuh (A.S.) had called his people for an extraordinarily long period.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 319504),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 324343),
          text: 'He had spoken to them night and day, publicly and privately.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 324343),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 328263),
          text: 'He had continued despite rejection and mockery.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 329501),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 337351),
          text:
              'Yet when the time came for Allah’s command concerning the Ark, the Qur’an tells us that only a few had believed with him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 338089),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 339711),
          text: 'Akhlaq stared at him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 339711),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 341271),
          text: 'Only a few?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 341271),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 344991),
          text: 'After all those years and all those different ways?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 345654),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 347111),
          text: 'Zameer answered yes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 347504),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 353239),
          text:
              'Mohsin looked confused and asked how they could then say that Nuh’s mission was successful.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 353660),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 361239),
          text:
              'Zameer explained that a Prophet’s success could not be measured simply by asking how many people accepted the message.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 361239),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 367239),
          text:
              'Nuh (A.S.) was successful because he faithfully carried out what Allah commanded him to do.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 367239),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 378047),
          text:
              'He conveyed the message, remained steadfast, warned his people, called them towards Allah and continued until Allah determined the next stage.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 378801),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 387471),
          text:
              'Imaan slowly said that his responsibility was the effort and obedience.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 390206),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 391443),
          text: 'Zameer agreed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 391443),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 396186),
          text: 'Guidance belonged to Allah.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 397629),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 417143),
          text:
              'Mohsina looked towards Bilal and his sister and realised that if only a few people responded to something good, that did not automatically make the effort worthless.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 417752),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 427783),
          text:
              'Zameer agreed, but cautioned that this lesson should never be used as an excuse for poor planning.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 427783),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 437751),
          text:
              'If nobody understood a message because it had been explained badly, the method should improve.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 437751),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 443191),
          text: 'If an activity was ineffective, they should learn.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 443518),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 454599),
          text:
              'Nuh (A.S.) did not teach them to ignore reality; he taught them not to confuse numbers with truth.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 455448),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 460119),
          text: 'Mohsin repeated the phrase, “Numbers with truth?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 460683),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 472367),
          text:
              'Zameer explained that if a hundred people chose something wrong, it did not become right merely because a hundred people chose it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 472367),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 482407),
          text:
              'And if only a few people remained upon what was right, the small number did not make the truth false.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 483093),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 493015),
          text:
              'Akhlaq looked towards the empty park entrance and realised that being popular and being right were two different things.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 493421),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 501655),
          text:
              'Imaan remembered the final lesson from Hazrat Idris (A.S.): people’s applause did not decide a person’s value.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 502077),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 506215),
          text:
              'Zameer smiled and said that the stories were beginning to connect.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 506682),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 515303),
          text:
              'Akhlaq pointed at Bilal and asked whether, if only two younger children joined them, they were supposed to act as if that was enough forever.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 516340),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 517583),
          text: 'Zameer said no.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 517583),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 526703),
          text:
              'They could still invite more people next time, ask why others had not come, choose a better time and make the activity more engaging.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 526703),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 531551),
          text:
              'But they should not look at the two who came and say that they were too few to matter.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 532551),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 533551),
          text: 'Mohsina smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 533551),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 540151),
          text:
              'Bilal’s sister had found a small plastic bottle and was carefully carrying it towards the bin.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 540151),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 544551),
          text:
              'She definitely thought she mattered, and Zameer said that she did.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 544551),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 547551),
          text: 'The children got up and began working.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 547551),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 551519),
          text: 'At first Akhlaq was still disappointed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 551519),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 556559),
          text:
              'Every few minutes he looked towards the gate, hoping someone else might appear.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 556559),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 557559),
          text: 'Nobody did.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 557559),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 563559),
          text:
              'Eventually, however, he put the clipboard aside and joined Bilal near the football ground.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 563559),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 567919),
          text:
              'Bilal was trying to carry a rubbish bag that was almost as large as he was.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 568887),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 572514),
          text: 'Akhlaq took one side and asked why he had come.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 572514),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 575847),
          text: 'Bilal simply said that they had asked him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 576727),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 581447),
          text:
              'His mother had told him that if they used the park, they should help keep it clean.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 582487),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 586209),
          text: 'Akhlaq smiled and said that Bilal had a good Ammi.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 586519),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 591855),
          text:
              'A few metres away, Mohsina was helping Bilal’s sister draw a small sign.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 591855),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 597855),
          text:
              'The child had written in large uneven letters, PLEASE KEEP OUR PARK HAPPY.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 598389),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 601855),
          text: 'Mohsin laughed and asked whether a park could be happy.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 601855),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 606855),
          text:
              'The little girl replied seriously that it looked happy when it was clean.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 606855),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 608823),
          text: 'Nobody argued with her.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 608823),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 613823),
          text:
              'By mid-morning, the six children had done more than Akhlaq expected.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 613823),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 617823),
          text: 'Because the group was small, everyone had a clear job.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 617823),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 626823),
          text:
              'Bilal collected bottles, his sister worked with Mohsina on signs, Mohsin cleaned around the benches, and Imaan checked the pathways.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 627275),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 630791),
          text:
              'Akhlaq eventually stopped looking at the empty gate altogether.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 630791),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 634791),
          text: 'Then two boys entered the park carrying a football.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 634791),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 638791),
          text:
              'They had been invited to the clean-up but had not come to help.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 638791),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 644791),
          text:
              'One looked at the group and laughed, asking whether that was their big clean-up and where everybody was.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 645648),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 649920),
          text:
              'Mohsin glanced at Akhlaq, waiting to see how he would respond.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 650501),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 656174),
          text:
              'Akhlaq looked at the six people working around him and said, “This is everybody who came.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 656174),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 660019),
          text: 'The boy laughed and said that was hardly anyone.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 660709),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 663072),
          text: 'Akhlaq replied, “Still enough to start.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 663072),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 667162),
          text: 'The boy shrugged and ran towards the football ground.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 667719),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 670887),
          text: 'Mohsina told Akhlaq that his answer had been good.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 670887),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 675407),
          text: 'He joked that he was growing, and Imaan said, “Slowly.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 675407),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 679287),
          text: 'As the morning continued, something unexpected happened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 679287),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 685287),
          text:
              'One woman passing through the park noticed Bilal and his sister cleaning beside the swings.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 685287),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 687607),
          text: 'She asked what they were doing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 687972),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 690949),
          text: 'Mohsina explained the project, and the woman smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 690949),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 698447),
          text:
              'She did not join them, but before leaving she called her own son and told him to put his empty bottle in the bin.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 698447),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 702916),
          text:
              'Later, the juice seller brought over a jug of water for the children.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 703386),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 706669),
          text: 'Akhlaq asked Zameer whether this counted as appreciation.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 707095),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 714609),
          text:
              'Zameer said that he was allowed to enjoy kindness, but tomorrow’s effort should not depend on receiving another jug.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 714609),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 719220),
          text: 'By the time they finished, the park looked better.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 719220),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 723023),
          text: 'It was not transformed by twenty volunteers.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 723023),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 728871),
          text:
              'There had been no crowd, photographs, applause or dramatic announcement.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 728871),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 732751),
          text: 'There had simply been six people doing useful work.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 733455),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 736151),
          text: 'Akhlaq gathered the unused badges.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 736151),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 741911),
          text:
              'He looked disappointed for a moment, then handed one to Bilal and one to his sister.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 741911),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 745911),
          text: 'The little girl placed hers proudly on her shirt.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 746280),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 749189),
          text: 'Akhlaq asked what they should do with the remaining badges.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 749680),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 752138),
          text: 'Mohsin said to keep them for next time.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 752629),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 759170),
          text:
              'Akhlaq asked whether there would be a next time, and Mohsina reminded him that he was the manager.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 759170),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 764265),
          text:
              'He immediately straightened and announced that of course there would be.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 764265),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 771847),
          text:
              'Before leaving, Imaan asked Zameer whether they knew exactly how many believers had been with Nuh (A.S.).',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 772233),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 778567),
          text:
              'Zameer shook his head and explained that the Qur’an tells us only that a few believed with him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 778567),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 782967),
          text:
              'They should not invent an exact number when Allah had not given one.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 783544),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 786887),
          text: 'Mohsin nodded and said that “few” was enough.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 787307),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 794135),
          text:
              'Akhlaq looked towards Bilal and his sister and said that today, few had been enough too — enough to do some good.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 794135),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 801655),
          text:
              'Then Zameer pointed towards some old wooden boards and unused bins near the park storage area.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 801655),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 811957),
          text:
              'The children had learned to keep working when people did not appreciate them, to change their method, to continue when people mocked them and not to measure truth only by numbers.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 811957),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 819523),
          text:
              'The next lesson, he said, was that sometimes they had to build something good before anyone believed it would work.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 819968),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 821999),
          text: 'Mohsin immediately understood: the Ark.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 822841),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 828926),
          text:
              'Akhlaq quickly clarified that their park did not need an Ark, and Zameer assured him it did not.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 828926),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 835919),
          text:
              'But perhaps it needed something more lasting than four children carrying rubbish bags every afternoon.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 835919),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 838471),
          text: 'All four looked around the park.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 838794),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 842511),
          text: 'Imaan noticed the overflowing basket beside the juice stall.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 843018),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 844962),
          text: 'Mohsin looked at the unused boards.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 844962),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 847751),
          text: 'Mohsina looked at the younger children.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 848439),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 852439),
          text:
              'Akhlaq slowly opened his clipboard and announced that management had an idea.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 853479),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 855639),
          text: 'Mohsin sighed that they were in trouble.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 856413),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 858439),
          text: 'Zameer smiled and walked away.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 859319),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 868399),
          text:
              'Behind him, the six children continued discussing what they could create so that the park would remain cleaner even when they were not there.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 868407),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 874967),
          text:
              'For the first time, Akhlaq was not thinking about how many people had failed to come.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 874967),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 878267),
          text: 'He was thinking about the few who had.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 878267),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 888407),
          text:
              'Sometimes a small beginning was still a beginning, and sometimes goodness did not need a crowd before it became worth doing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 888997),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 894178),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day: Do Not Measure Goodness Only by Numbers',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 894178),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 903194),
          text:
              'Choose one good activity today and do it even if only one person joins you, or even if nobody joins you at all.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 903194),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 913623),
          text:
              'Help clean a shared place, revise with a friend, assist someone younger, organise something useful, or begin a positive habit.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 913623),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 917543),
          text: 'Do not ask only, “How many people noticed?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 917543),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 924863),
          text:
              'Also ask: “Was the action good, was my intention sincere, and did I do my part properly?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 924863),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 925863),
          text: 'Level-Up',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 925863),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 932871),
          text:
              'Today, notice one situation where you are tempted to follow something merely because everyone else is doing it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 932871),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 938311),
          text:
              'Pause and ask: “Would this still be right if I were the only person choosing it?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 938311),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 944751),
          text:
              'A crowd does not turn wrong into right, and a small number does not make truth unimportant.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 944751),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 947791),
          text: 'Next Episode: Build Before They Understand',
        ),
      ],
    ),
    Story(
      id: 'nuh_en_05',
      title: 'Ep 5 · Build Before They Understand',
      narrator: 'Imaan & Akhlaq',
      coverAsset: 'assets/covers/nuh.webp',
      audioAsset: 'assets/audio/en/nuh/05_build_before_they_understand.ogg',
      category: StoryCategory.prophets,
      description: 'Hazrat Nuh (A.S.) — episode 5 of 6.',
      captions: [
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 164),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 3364),
          text: 'Episode 5: Build Before They Understand',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 4084),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 22132),
          text:
              'The following afternoon, Imaan, Akhlaq, Mohsin and Mohsina stood beside the park’s small storage area looking at a pile of old wooden boards, two unused plastic containers and one slightly crooked metal frame.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 22132),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 37132),
          text:
              'The park caretaker had agreed that the children could use some of the old material, but only on one condition: anything involving tools, nails or fixing structures had to be done with an adult present.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 37662),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 46780),
          text:
              'Akhlaq immediately nodded and said that this was reasonable because his management position did not include emergency carpentry.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 47347),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 51500),
          text:
              'Mohsin picked up one of the boards and looked at it carefully.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 51500),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 54220),
          text: '“What exactly are we building?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 54821),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 58514),
          text: 'Akhlaq opened his clipboard with unnecessary importance.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 58514),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 64425),
          text:
              'At the top of a new page he had written PROJECT: MAKE THE CLEANLINESS LAST.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 64425),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 67188),
          text: 'Underneath were several ideas.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 68148),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 72148),
          text:
              'One was a small labelled waste station near the football area.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 72868),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 78868),
          text:
              'Another was a weekly rota so the same four children did not have to clean everything themselves.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 80489),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 89156),
          text:
              'Mohsina had suggested making a board where younger children could place a small tick beside their name whenever they helped keep the park clean.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 89544),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 99556),
          text:
              'Imaan had added the most important point: anything they made had to be simple enough for the caretaker and community to continue using even when they were not there.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 100534),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 105124),
          text:
              'Mohsin looked impressed and admitted that it was actually a good plan.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 105803),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 110844),
          text:
              'Akhlaq smiled proudly and asked him to say it again, but Mohsin refused.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 111342),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 125412),
          text:
              'Mohsina pointed towards the containers and suggested labelling one for recyclable bottles and cans and the other for general rubbish, but first they should ask the caretaker what could actually be collected separately there.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 126116),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 127172),
          text: 'Imaan agreed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 127172),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 131972),
          text:
              'Otherwise, they might make a beautiful system that nobody could use.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 132470),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 138612),
          text:
              'Akhlaq remarked that this unfortunately described some of his previous plans very accurately.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 138612),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 141459),
          text: 'They went to the caretaker and explained their idea.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 141459),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 149700),
          text:
              'He liked the thought of a permanent waste point but simplified it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 149700),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 168268),
          text:
              'The local collection system did not separately collect every kind of waste, so instead of complicated categories, he suggested one clear rubbish point and a separate container only for clean plastic bottles that a recycling collector already picked up from nearby shops.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 168724),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 174188),
          text:
              'Akhlaq said that this was less exciting, and Imaan replied that it was more useful.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 174188),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 178772),
          text: 'With the caretaker’s help, they began preparing the area.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 178772),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 185876),
          text:
              'The children cleaned the old boards, painted a simple sign and measured where the containers would stand.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 185876),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 193876),
          text:
              'The caretaker handled the drilling and fixing while they held materials at a safe distance and passed him what he needed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 194569),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 196876),
          text: 'Mohsina painted the words: USE IT.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 196876),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 198876),
          text: 'CARE FOR IT.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 198876),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 199876),
          text: 'LEAVE IT BETTER.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 200444),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 203444),
          text: 'Mohsin added a small arrow towards the bins.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 204081),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 209444),
          text:
              'Akhlaq wanted to add MANAGED BY AKHLAQ AND ASSOCIATES, but the others refused.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 209444),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 214444),
          text:
              'By the time they had finished the first part, several people had stopped to watch.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 214444),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 217644),
          text: 'One man smiled and said it was a good idea.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 217644),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 222492),
          text:
              'A woman asked whether the children were doing it for a school assignment.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 222492),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 224772),
          text: 'But not everyone was encouraging.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 224772),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 230932),
          text:
              'Two older boys from the football ground stood nearby, looking at the half-built waste station.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 230932),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 234892),
          text:
              'One laughed and asked why they were doing all this for a park.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 234892),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 239652),
          text:
              'The other pointed towards the new board and said it would not last a week.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 239780),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 246800),
          text:
              'People would still throw rubbish, someone would break the sign, the bins would move and the children would get tired.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 246800),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 249120),
          text: 'They were wasting their time.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 249120),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 252400),
          text: 'For several seconds, nobody spoke.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 252813),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 256800),
          text:
              'Mohsin looked at what they had built and admitted that the boys might be right.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 256800),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 259520),
          text: 'Anything could fail, Mohsina replied.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 259748),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 265748),
          text:
              'But Mohsin meant that they could spend days making it and people might still not use it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 266498),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 269748),
          text: 'Akhlaq slowly put down his paintbrush.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 269748),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 271748),
          text: 'That thought had reached him too.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 271748),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 275748),
          text: 'Yesterday only a few people had come.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 275748),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 279748),
          text: 'Maybe they should wait until more people supported the idea.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 280057),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 282356),
          text: 'Mohsina asked what they were waiting for.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 282855),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 286516),
          text: 'Akhlaq replied that they needed proof that people wanted it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 286516),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 290516),
          text:
              'If nobody gave them that proof, perhaps they should not build it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 290516),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 297716),
          text:
              'A familiar voice came from behind them: “Sometimes proof arrives after the work begins.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 297716),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 304184),
          text:
              'They turned and saw Zameer standing near the tree, looking at the unfinished structure.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 304777),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 310024),
          text:
              'Akhlaq said that he had hoped Zameer would tell them to stop immediately and go home.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 310433),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 315744),
          text:
              'Zameer replied that he could say it if Akhlaq wanted, but it would not be today’s lesson.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 316087),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 319104),
          text: 'Zameer examined the board and asked what they were building.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 320076),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 332252),
          text:
              'Imaan explained the plan: a simple waste point, a rota, clearer signs and a way for more children to take responsibility instead of relying on the same four people.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 332600),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 344420),
          text:
              'Zameer asked whether they had consulted the caretaker, whether it was safe, whether there was a practical reason for it and whether they had changed the plan based on what the local waste system could actually handle.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 345140),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 348226),
          text: 'The answer to every question was yes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 348226),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 350900),
          text: 'So what, he asked, was the problem?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 352078),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 356180),
          text:
              'Mohsin pointed towards the football ground and said that people thought it would not work.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 357376),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 361250),
          text:
              'Zameer asked whether the children themselves knew it would work.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 361914),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 363908),
          text: 'Mohsin hesitated and said no.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 364439),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 366990),
          text: 'Zameer admitted that neither did he.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 367627),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 370708),
          text: 'Akhlaq said that this was not encouraging.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 371153),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 377028),
          text:
              'Zameer smiled slightly and told him that good work did not always come with a guarantee.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 377028),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 384395),
          text:
              'He sat with them beside the unfinished station and said that they had reached another important part of the story of Nuh (A.S.).',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 385556),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 389556),
          text:
              'Nuh had spent a very long time calling his people towards Allah.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 390556),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 396556),
          text:
              'He had tried different approaches, faced rejection and mockery, and only a few believed with him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 397556),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 408624),
          text:
              'Then Allah gave him a command that changed the direction of the story: Allah commanded Nuh (A.S.) to construct the Ark under His care and revelation.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 409038),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 413704),
          text:
              'Akhlaq looked at the wooden boards and said that this was the building episode.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 414143),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 417304),
          text: 'Zameer agreed but reminded them of the difference.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 417304),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 422532),
          text:
              'They were building a small park system after discussing it with responsible adults.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 422532),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 428292),
          text:
              'Nuh (A.S.) was carrying out a direct command from Allah as a Prophet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 428292),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 435812),
          text:
              'They were taking a lesson from his obedience and steadfastness, not comparing the two tasks as though they were equal.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 436315),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 440031),
          text: 'Imaan asked what exactly the Qur’an tells us about the Ark.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 440031),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 449740),
          text:
              'Zameer said that Allah commanded Nuh (A.S.) to build it and that he constructed it while leaders of his people passed by and mocked him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 450221),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 456180),
          text:
              'Mohsin asked how big it was, what type of wood was used and exactly where it was built.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 456574),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 463428),
          text:
              'Zameer explained that the Qur’an does not give measurements or a location they should turn into certain details.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 464021),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 468428),
          text:
              'Akhlaq smiled and said that Zameer was becoming very difficult to trap.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 468428),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 475428),
          text:
              'The important point, Zameer continued, was that Nuh (A.S.) began building because Allah had commanded him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 475428),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 480416),
          text:
              'The people who rejected him could not see what he knew through revelation.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 481844),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 485719),
          text:
              'Mohsina realised that to them, the Ark may have looked pointless.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 486228),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 492619),
          text:
              'Zameer said they mocked him while he was constructing it because they did not accept the warning he had been giving them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 492931),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 501244),
          text:
              'Imaan looked towards their own unfinished waste point and said that they felt uncomfortable because people could not yet see whether it would work.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 501697),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 510924),
          text:
              'Zameer agreed, but reminded them that unlike Nuh (A.S.), they did not have revelation telling them that their exact project would succeed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 510924),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 514324),
          text: 'Their responsibility was therefore different.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 514324),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 527772),
          text:
              'When Mohsin asked what their responsibility was, Zameer answered: to have a good purpose, make a sensible plan, seek advice, work safely, observe the results and improve.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 528343),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 538972),
          text:
              'Akhlaq nodded slowly and said that they could not say, “Nuh built the Ark even when people doubted him, therefore every idea I have must be brilliant.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 539834),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 543140),
          text: 'Zameer laughed and told him never to say that.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 543543),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 550060),
          text:
              'Imaan added that sometimes people disagreed with them because their idea really did need improvement.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 550824),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 551740),
          text: 'Zameer agreed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 551740),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 561268),
          text:
              'But once they had checked an idea carefully, the fact that someone said it would never work was not automatically a reason to abandon it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 561965),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 564228),
          text: 'Mohsina picked up her paintbrush again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 564806),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 566348),
          text: 'Mohsin was still thinking.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 566348),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 571748),
          text:
              'He asked what made Nuh (A.S.) keep building when people mocked him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 572243),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 576708),
          text: 'Zameer answered simply: he knew whose command he was obeying.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 576708),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 579428),
          text: 'That sentence made everyone quiet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 579679),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 584996),
          text:
              'Nuh (A.S.) did not need the people mocking him to understand first.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 584996),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 590856),
          text:
              'He did not need their permission to believe Allah or their applause before he obeyed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 590856),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 594896),
          text: 'The Ark was not made valuable by their opinion of it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 594896),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 598336),
          text: 'Its meaning came from the command of Allah.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 598554),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 608084),
          text:
              'Akhlaq looked down at his clipboard and realised that sometimes a person had to finish the right work before other people could see why it mattered.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 608524),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 616204),
          text:
              'Zameer agreed, but again reminded them that in everyday decisions, courage had to be combined with wisdom.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 616204),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 625172),
          text:
              'They should seek Allah’s pleasure through what was genuinely right, and also use the mind, advice and responsibility Allah had given them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 625172),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 629172),
          text: 'The next two days were slower than anyone expected.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 629172),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 631172),
          text: 'The paint needed time to dry.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 631172),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 635172),
          text: 'One of the old boards was too weak and had to be replaced.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 635172),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 645140),
          text:
              'The original place they had chosen blocked part of the pathway, so the caretaker made them move the entire station slightly closer to the wall.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 645602),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 650140),
          text:
              'Akhlaq complained when they had to repaint an arrow they had already finished.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 650468),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 655380),
          text:
              'Imaan handed him the brush and reminded him that the bin was now somewhere else.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 655794),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 659100),
          text:
              'Akhlaq announced that the project was attacking him personally.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 659664),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 661553),
          text: 'Mohsin made a simple weekly rota.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 662108),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 669108),
          text:
              'Instead of writing only their four names, they left empty spaces where other volunteers could join.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 669787),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 675108),
          text:
              'Mohsina created a small section called TODAY I HELPED OUR PARK BY...',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 675108),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 683076),
          text:
              'Children could write things like “used the bin,” “picked up a bottle,” or “reminded my friend.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 683403),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 689076),
          text:
              'Imaan worried that it might become a competition for praise, so they changed it slightly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 689076),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 694076),
          text: 'There would be no prizes, rankings or “best cleaner” titles.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 694076),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 699076),
          text: 'The purpose was simply to help children notice useful habits.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 699521),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 706344),
          text:
              'Akhlaq was disappointed that there would be no Cleanliness Champion or Golden Dustbin Award.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 706344),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 709404),
          text: 'By Friday, the waste station was ready.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 709404),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 712804),
          text: 'The children stood in front of it proudly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 712804),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 716964),
          text: 'It was not beautiful enough to appear in a magazine.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 716964),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 719645),
          text: 'One board leaned very slightly to one side.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 719645),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 722990),
          text: 'Their lettering was not perfectly straight.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 722990),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 731569),
          text:
              'The recycled-bottle container had once been bright blue and was now a tired shade somewhere between blue and grey.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 731959),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 732952),
          text: 'But it worked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 732952),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 737585),
          text:
              'The rubbish bin was positioned where people actually needed it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 737585),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 739758),
          text: 'The bottle container was clearly labelled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 740303),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 745576),
          text:
              'The rota was protected beneath a transparent sheet provided by the caretaker.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 745576),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 749441),
          text: 'And the sign could be read from across the path.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 750153),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 753676),
          text: 'Akhlaq folded his arms and admitted that he liked it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 754218),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 757468),
          text: 'Mohsin reminded him that he had designed half of it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 758100),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 762228),
          text:
              'Akhlaq replied that he had been waiting to see whether he approved.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 762228),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 767828),
          text:
              'Before anyone could answer, one of the older boys who had mocked them walked past.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 767828),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 771908),
          text: 'He stopped and asked whether they had actually finished it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 772768),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 773628),
          text: 'Akhlaq nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 773628),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 778708),
          text:
              'The boy examined the station and said that it still would not last.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 778708),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 782156),
          text: 'For a moment, Akhlaq looked disappointed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 782156),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 784411),
          text: 'Then he simply said, “Maybe.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 784411),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 787096),
          text: 'But we’ll take care of it and see.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 787096),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 789356),
          text: 'The boy shrugged and walked away.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 789876),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 792996),
          text: 'Mohsin was surprised that Akhlaq had not argued.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 793642),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 797516),
          text: 'Akhlaq replied that he was saving energy for maintenance.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 797516),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 801314),
          text: 'Over the following days, the children watched carefully.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 801314),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 804374),
          text: 'Some people used the bins and some did not.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 804374),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 810028),
          text:
              'A few younger children became excited about signing the “Today I Helped” board.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 810028),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 814962),
          text:
              'The juice seller began reminding customers that a bin was nearby.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 814962),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 817910),
          text: 'Bilal and his sister joined the rota.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 817910),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 819877),
          text: 'But there were problems too.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 819877),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 828265),
          text:
              'One afternoon, the bottle container overflowed because nobody had contacted the recycling collector.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 828265),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 832941),
          text: 'Another day, rain damaged one corner of their sign.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 833740),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 838272),
          text: 'Akhlaq looked at it and groaned that it was falling apart.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 838821),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 842420),
          text: 'Zameer happened to be nearby and told him to repair it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 843106),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 846340),
          text: 'Akhlaq asked whether it was really that simple.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 846740),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 851940),
          text:
              'Zameer asked whether the goal had been to create something that would never need care.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 853017),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 853940),
          text: 'Akhlaq said no.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 853940),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 858740),
          text: 'Then maintenance, Zameer explained, was part of building.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 859178),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 865308),
          text:
              'Imaan immediately wrote MAINTENANCE IS PART OF BUILDING on the back of Akhlaq’s clipboard.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 865308),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 870308),
          text:
              'He stared at it and complained that his clipboard was becoming a book.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 870308),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 874214),
          text: 'That evening, the children returned to the tree with Zameer.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 875519),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 881476),
          text:
              'Mohsina asked whether, when Nuh (A.S.) finished the Ark, the people finally understood.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 882244),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 885316),
          text: 'Zameer became quiet and said no.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 885316),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 888356),
          text: 'The Ark was not the end of the test.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 888356),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 890556),
          text: 'It was preparation.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 890997),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 899238),
          text:
              'Zameer explained that Allah’s command would eventually come, and Nuh (A.S.) was instructed concerning those who would board the Ark.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 899238),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 906307),
          text:
              'The believers who had followed him would enter, along with what Allah commanded him to take aboard.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 906781),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 912743),
          text:
              'Akhlaq immediately asked whether it was one pair of every animal in the entire world.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 913265),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 926692),
          text:
              'Zameer smiled slightly and explained that the Qur’an speaks of carrying pairs according to Allah’s command, but they should be careful about filling the story with details Allah had not specified.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 926692),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 930692),
          text: 'There would be no enormous animal list from him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 930692),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 934692),
          text: 'Then Zameer’s expression became more serious.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 934692),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 938660),
          text: 'The next part of Nuh’s story was not simply about building.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 938660),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 942820),
          text:
              'It was about what happened when the time for action finally arrived.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 943620),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 946425),
          text: 'For years, Nuh (A.S.) had warned his people.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 946425),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 949140),
          text: 'He had called them in different ways.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 949780),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 951918),
          text: 'They rejected him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 951918),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 953770),
          text: 'They mocked him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 953770),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 956050),
          text: 'Only a few believed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 956050),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 959520),
          text: 'Then Allah commanded him to build.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 959520),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 964868),
          text:
              'Eventually, the thing they had laughed at would no longer look pointless.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 966377),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 969668),
          text: 'Akhlaq said that this was because the result finally came.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 970970),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 975188),
          text:
              'Zameer nodded, but said the result would also carry a painful lesson.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 976847),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 978468),
          text: 'Mohsina asked what happened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 978993),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 989396),
          text:
              'Zameer replied that the final part of Nuh’s story would teach them something difficult: doing everything you can does not mean you control every outcome.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 989396),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 998556),
          text:
              'He explained that Nuh (A.S.) could invite, warn, build and obey, but there were choices he could not make for other people.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 999382),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1003564),
          text:
              'Mohsin asked whether that was true even for people close to him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1004036),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1008564),
          text:
              'Zameer looked at him and said yes, even someone from his own family.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1008981),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1013564),
          text:
              'Imaan’s expression changed as she realised he meant Nuh’s son.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1014288),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1016564),
          text: 'Akhlaq’s usual humour disappeared.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1018532),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1025181),
          text:
              'Zameer told them that this was where the story would finish, and where they would understand the deepest meaning of their project.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1025181),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1033110),
          text:
              'They had spent days learning that sincere goodness was not wasted simply because people failed to respond.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1033110),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1039138),
          text:
              'Now they had to learn the other half: You are responsible for sincere effort.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1039138),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1042114),
          text: 'You are not the owner of the result.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1042114),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1045091),
          text: 'Then he left them beneath the tree.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1045091),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1050213),
          text: 'The children looked towards their newly built station.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1050213),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1052020),
          text: 'People might use it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1052020),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1053940),
          text: 'Some might ignore it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1053940),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1055556),
          text: 'It might need repairs.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1055556),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1057980),
          text: 'It might inspire other children.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1058468),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1061748),
          text: 'It might one day disappear completely.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1061748),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1070148),
          text:
              'But none of that could change one fact: they had tried to make something good, responsibly and sincerely.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1070148),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1075828),
          text:
              'Perhaps the value of a good effort was not only in how long the thing remained.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1075828),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1080556),
          text:
              'Perhaps some of its value remained in the people who had learned how to care.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1082076),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1086316),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day: Build Something That Can Continue',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1087116),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1094796),
          text:
              'Instead of doing one good action only once, choose one small way to make that goodness easier to continue.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1095436),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1115404),
          text:
              'For example, create a simple study timetable instead of depending on motivation, place a waste basket where rubbish usually gathers, organise your books so you can keep your room tidy, make a family reminder for saving water, or create a rota so one person is not responsible for everything.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1115404),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1121972),
          text:
              'Ask yourself: “What can I build today that makes tomorrow’s good action easier?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1121972),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1123772),
          text: 'Level-Up',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1123772),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1129172),
          text:
              'Before starting a new idea, check four things: Is the goal good?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1129172),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1131272),
          text: 'Is the method sensible?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1131272),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1132572),
          text: 'Is it safe?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1132572),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1136452),
          text: 'Have I asked the right people for advice or permission?',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1136452),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1137772),
          text: 'Then begin.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1137772),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1143220),
          text:
              'Do not abandon a sensible good effort simply because someone says, “That will never work.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1143720),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1148820),
          text:
              'But remain humble enough to improve it when the evidence shows that something needs changing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1149520),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1152020),
          text: 'Next Episode: What Remains',
        ),
      ],
    ),
    Story(
      id: 'nuh_en_06',
      title: 'Ep 6 · What Remains',
      narrator: 'Imaan & Akhlaq',
      coverAsset: 'assets/covers/nuh.webp',
      audioAsset: 'assets/audio/en/nuh/06_what_remains.ogg',
      category: StoryCategory.prophets,
      description: 'Hazrat Nuh (A.S.) — episode 6 of 6.',
      captions: [
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 219),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 2579),
          text: 'Episode 6: What Remains',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 3119),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 16927),
          text:
              'The following morning, Imaan, Akhlaq, Mohsin and Mohsina reached the park expecting to check their new waste station, empty the bottle container and repair the corner of the sign that had been damaged by rain.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 17727),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 20767),
          text: 'Instead, they stopped several steps away from it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 21567),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 30735),
          text:
              'One of the containers had fallen onto its side, the rota sheet had slipped from beneath its cover, and a few bottles had rolled across the path.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 31444),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 34175),
          text: 'Akhlaq stared at the scene in disbelief.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 34175),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 37455),
          text: '“We spent days making this,” he said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 37924),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 40895),
          text: 'Mohsin picked up one of the bottles and looked around.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 40895),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 46768),
          text:
              'There had been strong wind during the night, and it seemed that the container had not been fixed firmly enough.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 46768),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 49372),
          text: 'For a few moments, nobody moved.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 49997),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 54592),
          text:
              'Mohsina finally lifted the rota sheet and wiped the dust from its cover.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 54592),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 57848),
          text: '“At least it isn’t completely destroyed,” she said.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 58454),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 64703),
          text:
              'Akhlaq looked unconvinced and said that this was not the encouraging sentence she thought it was.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 65023),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 70892),
          text:
              'Imaan examined the base of the container and realised that one of the simple supports had loosened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 70892),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 72511),
          text: 'She said they could fix it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 73020),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 75311),
          text: 'Mohsin nodded, but Akhlaq remained quiet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 76431),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 78191),
          text: 'Imaan asked what he was thinking.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 78591),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 85325),
          text:
              'Akhlaq looked towards the fallen sign and said that he was thinking about what Zameer had said the previous day.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 85325),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 91119),
          text:
              'They could make the effort, but they did not control everything that happened afterwards.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 91636),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 96199),
          text:
              'Mohsina smiled faintly and said that this sounded surprisingly mature.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 96683),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 101999),
          text:
              'Akhlaq replied that he was having a difficult morning and asked her not to make it worse.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 101999),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 107121),
          text:
              'Before they could begin repairing anything, Bilal and his little sister entered the park.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 107121),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 111567),
          text:
              'Bilal noticed the fallen container and immediately ran towards them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 112127),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 118687),
          text:
              'When Mohsin explained that the wind had probably caused it, Bilal put down his football and asked if he could help.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 118687),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 122767),
          text: 'His sister began collecting the bottles without being asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 123247),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 125158),
          text: 'Akhlaq watched her for a moment.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 125158),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 131455),
          text:
              'Only a few weeks earlier, she had come to their clean-up day because her mother had encouraged her.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 131455),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 136575),
          text:
              'Now she was picking up rubbish as though it were naturally her responsibility too.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 136575),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 140575),
          text:
              'Then two boys who regularly played football came through the gate.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 140575),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 145535),
          text:
              'One of them was among those who had once laughed at the children for cleaning.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 145535),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 145668),
          text: 'He looked at the fallen station, then at Akhlaq.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 145668),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 145750),
          text: 'Akhlaq expected another joke.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 145750),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 145781),
          text:
              'Instead, the boy bent down, picked up one of the bottles and placed it inside the container.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 145781),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 145842),
          text: 'He said that the support needed fixing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 145842),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 145863),
          text: 'Akhlaq stared at him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 145863),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 145893),
          text: 'The boy asked why he was looking at him strangely.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 165951),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 168031),
          text: 'Akhlaq replied that he was adjusting to new information.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 168031),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 170111),
          text: 'The boy smiled and walked away.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 171150),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 174271),
          text:
              'Mohsin whispered that he could not believe what had just happened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 175287),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 179231),
          text:
              'Mohsina pointed out that there had been no announcement and no apology.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 179569),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 184031),
          text:
              'Imaan looked around at the children helping them and said that something had changed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 184405),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 187719),
          text:
              'Akhlaq remembered the final question from the previous evening.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 187719),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 196977),
          text:
              'They had been working for days to improve one small place, but perhaps the greatest result was no longer the sign, the bin or the rota.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 197639),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 201799),
          text:
              'Perhaps it was the habit beginning to grow inside other people.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 201799),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 203959),
          text: 'Just then, Zameer arrived.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 203959),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 211887),
          text:
              'He looked at the fallen station, the children repairing it and the bottles being collected, and observed that they seemed busy.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 212372),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 219887),
          text:
              'Akhlaq pointed towards the damaged container and said that their great construction had not survived one windy night.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 220364),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 223887),
          text: 'Zameer smiled and noted that they were repairing it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 224187),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 230495),
          text:
              'Akhlaq admitted that they were, although with considerably less enthusiasm.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 230824),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 240415),
          text:
              'Zameer looked at Bilal’s sister, who was returning the final bottle to the container, and observed that apparently the four children were no longer the only ones involved.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 240415),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 242695),
          text: 'The children became quiet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 243046),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 245823),
          text: 'Imaan knew where the conversation was going.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 245823),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 252063),
          text:
              'She reminded Zameer that the previous day he had said they had reached the final part of Nuh’s story.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 252063),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 254583),
          text: 'They gathered beneath their usual tree.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 254959),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 258943),
          text:
              'Zameer began by reminding them of everything they had already learned.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 259258),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 265663),
          text:
              'Nuh (A.S.) had called his people towards Allah for an extraordinarily long period.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 265791),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 275311),
          text:
              'He had called them night and day, spoken publicly and privately, continued despite rejection, endured mockery, and only a few believed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 275311),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 279991),
          text: 'Then, by Allah’s command, he built the Ark.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 279991),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 283551),
          text: 'The time eventually came when Allah’s command was fulfilled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 286146),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 293839),
          text:
              'Nuh (A.S.) was instructed to take aboard those whom Allah had commanded, including the believers who were with him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 294296),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 305759),
          text:
              'Akhlaq raised his hand as though they were in class and asked whether Zameer would now tell them exactly how many animals there were, the exact size of the Ark and how many floors it had.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 306335),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 308765),
          text: 'Zameer answered no to each question.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 309272),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 314198),
          text:
              'Akhlaq lowered his hand and said that he had known this would happen.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 314669),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 330735),
          text:
              'Zameer smiled and reminded them that there were many details mentioned in later stories and historical reports, but their rule remained the same: where the Qur’an and authentic teachings did not give certainty, they should not turn imagination into fact.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 332067),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 333838),
          text: 'Mohsina asked what they did know.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 334281),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 336495),
          text: 'Zameer replied that they knew enough.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 337455),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 349543),
          text:
              'Allah’s command came, Nuh (A.S.) boarded the Ark with the believers according to Allah’s instruction, the water rose and the Ark moved through enormous waves.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 350017),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 352623),
          text: 'Akhlaq said that it must have been frightening.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 353013),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 363843),
          text:
              'Zameer answered carefully that they could understand the event was tremendous, but the Qur’an did not need them to invent every emotion or dramatic detail.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 363843),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 366449),
          text: 'It gave them something far more powerful.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 366449),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 372271),
          text:
              'During this great moment, Nuh (A.S.) saw one of his sons who had not boarded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 372831),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 374943),
          text: 'The children became silent.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 375494),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 378431),
          text: 'Mohsin asked whether it was really his own son.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 379659),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 380370),
          text: 'Zameer said yes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 380675),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 390359),
          text:
              'Nuh (A.S.) called to him lovingly and urged him to come aboard with the believers and not remain with those who rejected the truth.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 390986),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 394119),
          text: 'Mohsina looked troubled and asked whether he came.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 394826),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 396239),
          text: 'Zameer shook his head.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 396239),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 402599),
          text:
              'The son believed he could save himself by going to a mountain that would protect him from the water.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 403199),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 411487),
          text:
              'Nuh (A.S.) told him that on that day there was no protection from Allah’s decree except for those upon whom Allah had mercy.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 411887),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 414087),
          text: 'Then a wave came between them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 414487),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 416647),
          text: 'The son did not join the Ark.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 417087),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 419607),
          text: 'For several moments, nobody spoke.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 419967),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 422127),
          text: 'Even Akhlaq had no joke.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 422936),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 431775),
          text:
              'Imaan finally said that after all those years of Nuh (A.S.) calling people, even someone from his own family had not listened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 432317),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 432859),
          text: 'Zameer agreed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 432859),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 440162),
          text:
              'He explained that this was why the story teaches something extremely important about effort.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 440162),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 451663),
          text:
              'A person can advise someone, love them, explain, invite and set an example, but cannot place guidance inside another person’s heart by force.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 452124),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 459903),
          text:
              'Mohsin stared at the ground and realised that Nuh (A.S.) had done everything he could but could not make the decision for his son.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 460958),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 462223),
          text: 'Zameer agreed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 462744),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 465463),
          text:
              'Mohsina then asked whether his effort had therefore been wasted.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 466241),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 469471),
          text: 'Zameer answered immediately: no.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 469835),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 473471),
          text:
              'Nuh (A.S.) was responsible for carrying out the mission Allah gave him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 473471),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 477471),
          text: 'The choices of other people did not erase his obedience.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 477471),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 481471),
          text: 'That sentence settled heavily over the children.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 481828),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 488439),
          text:
              'Zameer continued that afterwards, Nuh (A.S.) called upon Allah concerning his son.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 488439),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 496039),
          text:
              'Allah corrected his understanding and taught him not to ask regarding that of which he did not have knowledge.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 496429),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 504839),
          text:
              'Nuh (A.S.) immediately turned back to Allah, sought His protection from asking what he did not know, and asked for forgiveness and mercy.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 505911),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 510447),
          text:
              'Akhlaq looked surprised and asked whether even a Prophet was corrected.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 511847),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 512574),
          text: 'Zameer said yes.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 512574),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 519967),
          text:
              'When Akhlaq asked whether he accepted the correction, Zameer replied that he did so immediately.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 521175),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 532766),
          text:
              'Imaan smiled faintly and realised that even at the end, the story was teaching them not to think that being on the right side meant they were always personally right.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 533229),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 543535),
          text:
              'Zameer was pleased that she remembered the lesson of Idris (A.S.): truth was something a person submitted to, not something used to feel superior.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 545816),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 552143),
          text:
              'Zameer then explained that Allah commanded the earth to swallow its water and the sky to stop.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 552143),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 560863),
          text:
              'The waters receded, the matter was settled, and the Ark came to rest upon Al-Judi, as the Qur’an tells us.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 561267),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 568031),
          text:
              'Mohsin thought about this and said that after all those years, Nuh (A.S.) had finally seen the result.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 568904),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 569951),
          text: 'Zameer agreed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 570376),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 575551),
          text:
              'Mohsin wondered whether the result was therefore the important part after all.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 576145),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 579111),
          text: 'Zameer smiled and asked which result.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 579111),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 605279),
          text:
              'The Ark survived and the believers were saved, but there was another result that continued far beyond the Ark.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 605279),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 605648),
          text:
              'Zameer opened the Qur’an and explained that in Surah As-Saffat, after mentioning Nuh (A.S.), Allah tells us that He preserved for him an honourable remembrance among later generations, followed by the declaration: Peace upon Nuh among the worlds.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 605648),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 605684),
          text: 'Imaan’s eyes widened.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 605684),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 605720),
          text: 'It was his name.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 605720),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 606288),
          text: 'Zameer nodded.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 606288),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 609031),
          text: 'The people who mocked him were gone.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 609031),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 611018),
          text: 'Their laughter had ended.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 611018),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 613782),
          text: 'Their approval no longer mattered.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 613782),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 617234),
          text: 'But Allah preserved the remembrance of Nuh (A.S.).',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 618384),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 626826),
          text: 'Mohsina was amazed that people were still learning from him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 627229),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 634268),
          text:
              'Zameer pointed out that thousands of years later, four children sitting under a tree were discussing his patience.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 634655),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 641362),
          text:
              'Akhlaq looked towards the park and said that they were cleaning because of something they had learned from his story.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 641721),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 645215),
          text:
              'Zameer reminded him again that Nuh (A.S.) did not clean parks.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 645633),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 651183),
          text:
              'Akhlaq agreed and clarified that they were learning from his example of continuing good effort.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 651534),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 661183),
          text:
              'Zameer explained that this was why they should be careful when saying, “Nobody noticed, so it did not matter,” or, “Nobody thanked me, so my effort was wasted.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 661183),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 665151),
          text: 'Allah sees what people overlook.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 665151),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 673231),
          text:
              'A sincere good action may leave effects a person never lives long enough to see.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 673562),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 681551),
          text:
              'Imaan looked towards Bilal and his sister and observed that when the project began, they were not part of it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 681551),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 684991),
          text: 'Now they helped without being asked.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 685554),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 692239),
          text:
              'Mohsin pointed towards the football ground and said that an older boy had used the bottle bin that morning.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 692829),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 696759),
          text: 'Akhlaq added that he had done so without making a speech.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 697516),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 700639),
          text: 'Mohsina joked that perhaps this was the miracle.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 700964),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 707087),
          text:
              'Zameer quickly reminded her that the word miracle should be reserved for where it belongs.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 707759),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 710927),
          text: 'Akhlaq changed it to “a surprising development.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 711358),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 718007),
          text:
              'Zameer asked whether, if the sign disappeared tomorrow, everything they had done would become useless.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 719084),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 720007),
          text: 'Akhlaq said no.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 720007),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 723367),
          text: 'If the container eventually broke, no.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 723367),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 729055),
          text:
              'If they moved away one day, the people who had learned the habit could still continue it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 729518),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 738855),
          text:
              'Zameer agreed and reminded them that even if they never saw what came from one sincere good action, Allah knew that action.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 738855),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 769991),
          text:
              'Mohsin slowly said that goodness could remain in more than one way: in the place, in another person, in a habit and in their reward with Allah.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 771972),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 780991),
          text:
              'Zameer smiled and said that the last one was the most important.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 780991),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 787679),
          text:
              'Later that afternoon, the caretaker helped them secure the container properly.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 787679),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 791879),
          text: 'They repaired the sign and replaced the damaged rota sheet.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 791879),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 799479),
          text:
              'It looked almost exactly as it had before the storm, but the children no longer looked at it in quite the same way.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 799984),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 804927),
          text:
              'Akhlaq had previously wanted the project to last because a broken project felt like failure.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 804927),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 814927),
          text:
              'Now he understood that maintaining something was part of responsibility, but the physical structure was not the only measure of what they had achieved.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 814927),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 820927),
          text:
              'As they were packing up, Mohsina noticed a younger child approaching the waste station with his father.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 820927),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 827771),
          text:
              'The child finished a small juice box, walked towards the bin and threw it inside.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 827771),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 829825),
          text: 'His father continued walking.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 829825),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 831909),
          text: 'The boy suddenly called out, “Abbu!”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 832324),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 833880),
          text: 'His father turned.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 833880),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 835333),
          text: '“You forgot yours.”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 835333),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 841647),
          text:
              'The man looked at the empty bottle in his hand, laughed and walked back towards the bin.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 841647),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 843495),
          text: 'The four children watched.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 843918),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 847423),
          text: 'Akhlaq whispered that nobody had taught the father.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 847803),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 850463),
          text: 'Imaan smiled and said that the child had.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 850463),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 852463),
          text: 'They looked at one another.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 852463),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 862063),
          text:
              'Goodness had moved from one person to another, from older children to younger ones, and now perhaps from the younger one back to an adult.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 862452),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 866830),
          text:
              'Mohsin smiled and said that goodness spread in strange directions.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 867356),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 870618),
          text: 'Zameer, standing nearby, heard him and agreed.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 871144),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 877523),
          text:
              'Akhlaq looked at their repaired sign and asked whether this meant they had finished the project.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 878016),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 884511),
          text:
              'Mohsina laughed and reminded him that keeping a place clean was not something a person finished forever.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 885561),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 888799),
          text: 'Akhlaq sighed that he had been afraid she would say that.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 889132),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 894199),
          text:
              'Imaan added that perhaps they did not have to do everything themselves anymore.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 894199),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 895429),
          text: 'They looked at the rota.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 895839),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 897561),
          text: 'Bilal’s name was there.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 897561),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 899665),
          text: 'His sister’s name was there.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 899665),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 902439),
          text: 'Two more children had added theirs.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 902439),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 905439),
          text: 'And beneath them, someone had written a new name.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 905439),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 910137),
          text:
              'It belonged to one of the older boys who had once mocked them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 910712),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 913500),
          text: 'Akhlaq stared and asked who had asked him.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 914104),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 916116),
          text: 'Mohsin replied that nobody had.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 916116),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 920166),
          text: 'For once, Akhlaq did not announce the achievement.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 920166),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 921527),
          text: 'He simply smiled.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 921527),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 929775),
          text:
              'Before they left, Zameer called the four children together one final time and asked what Nuh (A.S.) had taught them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 930366),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 936375),
          text:
              'Mohsin said not to stop a good effort merely because people did not appreciate it.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 937221),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 941975),
          text:
              'Mohsina said that if one method did not work, improve the method.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 942351),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 947703),
          text:
              'Imaan said not to let mockery decide whether something right became wrong.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 948259),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 952703),
          text:
              'Akhlaq added not to measure everything by how many people joined.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 953189),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 959703),
          text:
              'Mohsin remembered that they had to build responsibly even before everyone understood.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 960466),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 969511),
          text:
              'Mohsina added today’s lesson: do your part, but remember that you do not control people’s choices or every result.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 969937),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 977151),
          text:
              'Akhlaq looked towards the park and added that goodness could remain after the person who started it was gone.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 977587),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 983071),
          text:
              'Zameer smiled and said that this might be the lesson he wanted them to remember most.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 983266),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 986639),
          text:
              'He took Akhlaq’s famous clipboard and turned to the final page.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 986639),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 992639),
          text: 'Then he wrote six short lines: Seek Allah’s pleasure.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 992639),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 994639),
          text: 'Make sincere effort.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 994639),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 996639),
          text: 'Improve your method.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 996639),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 999639),
          text: 'Stay steady through mockery.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 999639),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1002639),
          text: 'Leave the results to Allah.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1002639),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1024607),
          text: 'Let goodness continue after you.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1024607),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1024660),
          text: 'Akhlaq read them silently.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1024660),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1024793),
          text: 'Then he looked at the first page of the clipboard.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1024793),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1024886),
          text: 'His original plan had said: Clean everything.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1024886),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1024953),
          text: 'Tell everyone not to litter.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1024953),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1025006),
          text: 'Hope for the best.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1025006),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1025112),
          text: 'He laughed and announced that he had improved.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1025112),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1031015),
          text: 'Imaan agreed considerably, but refused to put it in writing.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1031015),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1033735),
          text: 'They began walking home.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1033735),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1036615),
          text: 'Behind them, the park was not perfect.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1036615),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1040095),
          text: 'There were still people who might litter tomorrow.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1040095),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1043615),
          text: 'The sign would eventually need repairing again.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1043615),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1046377),
          text: 'The rota might sometimes be forgotten.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1046377),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1050043),
          text: 'And not everyone who entered the park would care.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1050043),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1058320),
          text:
              'But something now existed that had not existed when the four children first carried six rubbish bags through the gate.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1058320),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1071511),
          text:
              'There were people who noticed, children who remembered, a system that made the good action easier, and a small community beginning to understand that a shared place belonged to all of them.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1071511),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1076003),
          text:
              'The children could not control how long every result would last.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1076003),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1081511),
          text:
              'But they could control what kind of people they became while making the effort.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1081511),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1084479),
          text: 'That was their responsibility.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1084479),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1102519),
          text:
              'From the story of Nuh (A.S.), they had learned something they hoped they would never forget: people may ignore your goodness, misunderstand it, laugh at it or even refuse it, but a sincere good effort made for Allah is never worthless.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1102519),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1106947),
          text:
              'The people who mocked Nuh (A.S.) could not preserve their laughter.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1106947),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1112947),
          text:
              'But Allah preserved the honour of His Prophet: Peace upon Nuh among the worlds.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1112947),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1120947),
          text:
              'Perhaps that was the greatest answer to the question with which their whole journey had begun: “What was the point?”',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1120947),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1124415),
          text: 'The point was never merely to be appreciated.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1124415),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1136615),
          text:
              'The point was to do what was right, seek Allah’s pleasure, fulfil your responsibility, and leave behind whatever goodness Allah allowed your effort to grow.',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1136615),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1140100),
          text: 'Challenge of the Day: Leave Something Good Behind',
        ),
        CaptionLine(
          start: Duration(milliseconds: 1140100),
          end: Duration(milliseconds: 1146383),
          text:
              'Choose one good action this week that can continue benefiting someone after you have finished doing it.',
